 Which one of the following statements can be inferred from the given passage?', '{"A": "Nation-states do not have environmental concerns.", "B": "Nation-states are responsible for providing fresh water to billions of people.", "C": "Billions of people are responsible for man-made emissions.", "D": "Billions of people are affected by melting glaciers."}', 'D', 0, 1, 'gatecse-2020,verbal-aptitude,verbal-reasoning,passage-reading,one-mark', 0, 'filter1_vol1.pdf', 369);
