   time) of work2 compared to work1', '{"A": "S1 is false and S2 is false", "B": "S1 is false and S2 is true", "C": "S1 is true and S2 is false", "D": "S1 is true and S2 is true"}', 'A', 0, 1, 'gatecse-2006,compiler-design,normal,code-optimization', 1, 'filter1_vol2.pdf', 124);
